Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:09.354 --> 00:00:12.891
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.941 --> 00:00:16.671
Today we learn: My Dream Job. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.111 --> 00:00:22.328
Dream job. Say it with me. Dream job!

6
00:00:25.836 --> 00:00:29.269
Skill. Say it with me. Skill!

7
00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:36.637
Passion. Say it with me. Passion!

8
00:00:40.134 --> 00:00:44.018
Career. Say it with me. Career!

9
00:00:47.524 --> 00:00:51.007
Goal. Say it with me. Goal!

10
00:00:54.495 --> 00:00:58.345
Ambition. Say it with me. Ambition!

11
00:01:01.866 --> 00:01:05.566
Talent. Say it with me. Talent!

12
00:01:09.046 --> 00:01:12.396
Future. Say it with me. Future!

13
00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:25.491
Grammar time! I want to become a, . Listen. I want to become a doctor. I want to become an engineer.

14
00:01:25.541 --> 00:01:31.990
Your turn. Say it with me. I want to become a doctor. I want to become an engineer.

15
00:01:37.282 --> 00:01:50.610
Everyone has a dream job they imagine for their future. Mine requires a special skill and a lot of passion. I set goals and work on my talent every day, because ambition helps turn dreams into a real career.

16
00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:52.043
I like this story!

17
00:01:52.829 --> 00:01:58.429
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:58.479 --> 00:01:59.629
Passion!

19
00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:05.900
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:07.100
Talent!

21
00:02:07.953 --> 00:02:16.960
Think and answer. What is your dream job, and what skill do you need to achieve it?

22
00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:18.160
Great answer!

23
00:02:19.243 --> 00:02:21.638
This unit's value is Ambition.

24
00:02:21.688 --> 00:02:23.543
I can show ambition every day!

25
00:02:24.256 --> 00:02:28.707
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:28.757 --> 00:02:30.367
